--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -20,6 +20,12 @@ Open the moderator area using the hostname your audience can reach. On a quiz pa
 
 Each run has its own join code, players and answers. The big screen and phones update in place; the QR code, JavaScript, and fonts are served locally. See [implementation notes](docs/implementation.md) for reconnect and presence behavior.
 
+## Award prizes
+
+Set **Number of winners** in quiz settings (default: 3) before starting a game. Each correct final pick is worth one point. At **End quiz**, the big screen ranks everyone by points, breaking ties by the total time spent on correct answers. Each phone shows only its own place and points.
+
+Use **Top N** to award prizes in leaderboard order, or **Draw** to choose randomly between players tied on points at the cutoff. Each click draws again. Zero-point players never win. **Reset winners** clears the award marks without changing the results. Keep the leaderboard and phones open to see awards update live.
+
 ## Reuse a quiz
 
 Open the quiz and choose **Export** to copy its JSON, including inactive questions and answer keys. On another installation (or the same one), choose **Import quiz** on `/moderate`, paste into **Quiz JSON**, and choose **Import**. This creates a new quiz; it never replaces one with a matching title.
